  "goodToKnow": "Die Freistellung is release from work duties, often with pay, like garden leave after a dismissal: eine bezahlte Freistellung. It also means exemption. German bank customers file a Freistellungsauftrag so that investment income up to an allowance isn't taxed. Freistellen also means to leave up to someone: Das ist dir freigestellt. Plural: die Freistellungen."
